  "decision_conditions": [
    "The development hereby permitted shall be commenced before the expiration of three years from the date of this permission.<br>",
    "<p class=\"MsoNormal\">The materials to be used in the construction of the external surfaces of the development hereby permitted shall match those used in the existing dwellinghouse.<br></p>",
    "The proposed Air Source Heat Pumps shall be installed in accordance with the noise mitigation measures\r\nrecommended in section 4 of the Plant Noise Assessment Ref: WIE20397-100-R-1.2.4 by Waterman Infrastructure\r\nand Environmental Limited.&nbsp;",
    "&lt;p&gt;The development hereby approved shall only be carried out in accordance with the following approved plans and documents:&lt;/p&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;Plant Noise Impact Assessment (prepared by Waterman Infrastructure &amp;amp; Environment Ltd, document ref: &lt;span style=&quot;font-size: 14.6667px;&quot;&gt;W&lt;/span&gt;IE20397-100-R-1.2.4, dated: May 2024)&lt;li&gt;Solar Glare Assessment (prepared by Anstey Horne, document ref:&amp;nbsp; CR/SM/ROL01226, dated: November 2023)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proposed Elevations (drawing ref:&amp;nbsp;FJM141-TPB-XX-XX-DR-A-1400-S4, revision: 01, dated: 09/10/2023)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proposed Site Plan (drawing ref: FJM141-TPB-XX-XX-DR-A-1100-S4, revision: 01, dated: 04/10/2023)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;D&lt;b&gt;esign and Access Statement&amp;nbsp;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Proposed Window Types (drawing ref: 2700, revision: P01, dated: 01/11/2023)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Site Location and Block Plan&amp;nbsp;(ref: 1000, revision: P01, dated: 04/11/2023)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;Planning Statement (dated: 30/09/2024)&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;p&gt;No other drawings or documents apply.&lt;/p&gt;"
